# After `getschema`, the input columns are gone.
mode: check
show: schema
schema: 'orders.csv'(orderId: string, customerId: string, amount: real, qty: long, timestamp: datetime)
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | getschema | where amount > 1
---- expected
error[DS1001]: unknown column `amount`
  --> query:1:39
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | getschema | where amount > 1
  |                                       ^^^^^^ no column named `amount` here
  |
  = note: columns available at this point: ColumnName, ColumnOrdinal, DataType

query 1 columns:
  ColumnName: string
  ColumnOrdinal: long
  DataType: string
